[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0010","text":"鬼，被消灭也是理所当然的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0020","text":"鬼，没有容身之处"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0030","text":"我……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0040","text":"如果我能成为没有容身之处的人的容身之处────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0050","text":"『呜，被打败了～～～！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0060","text":"鬼，只要是鬼，就永远没有容身之处────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0080","text":"温柔的鬼同学，辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0090","text":"……欢迎回来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_03_0100","text":"我，我回来了……！"}]
